{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43558","headline":"蔷薇花联句 · 裴度","name":"蔷薇花联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"似锦如霞色，连春接夏开。\n波红分影入，风好带香来。\n得地依东阁，当阶奉上台。\n浅深皆有态，次第暗相催。\n满地愁英落，缘堤惜櫂回。\n芳浓濡雨露，明丽隔尘埃。\n似着臙脂染，如经巧妇裁。\n奈花无别计，只有酒残杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}